{
  "id": "individual___universal_gas_constants__definitions_",
  "title": "Individual & Universal Gas Constants: Definitions, Values, and Applications",
  "description": "Calculator and reference tool for individual and universal gas constants. Calculate individual gas constant from universal constant and molecular weight, or look up values for common gases in multiple unit systems.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Individual Gas Constant Calculator\n\nCalculate the individual gas constant from the universal gas constant and molecular weight using the formula:\n\n**R = Ru / Mgas**\n\nwhere:\n- R = Individual Gas Constant\n- Ru = Universal Gas Constant\n- Mgas = Molecular Weight of the gas"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "ru",
          "label": "Universal Gas Constant (Ru)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 8.3144598,
          "unit": "J/(mol·K)"
        },
        {
          "id": "mgas",
          "label": "Molecular Weight (Mgas)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 28.9647,
          "unit": "g/mol"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "r_si",
          "label": "Individual Gas Constant (R)",
          "formula": "inputs.ru / (inputs.mgas / 1000)",
          "unit": "J/(kg·K)",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "r_imperial",
          "label": "Individual Gas Constant (R)",
          "formula": "(inputs.ru / (inputs.mgas / 1000)) * 5.97994",
          "unit": "ft·lbf/slug·°R",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Universal Gas Constant Values\n\nThe universal gas constant (Ru) in common units:\n\n- **J/(mol·K)**: 8.3144598\n- **kJ/(kmol·K)**: 8.3144598\n- **J/(kmol·K)**: 8314.472\n- **atm·L/(mol·K)**: 0.082057338\n- **cal/(mol·K)**: 1.9872\n- **Btu/(lbmol·°R)**: 1.9872036\n- **lbf·ft/(lbmol·°R)**: 1545.349\n- **psi·ft³/(lbmol·°R)**: 10.73\n\nThe universal gas constant is the same for all ideal or perfect gases."
    },
