      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Key Relationships\n\n**Individual Gas Constant (R):**\n- R = Ru / Mgas\n- Depends on the particular gas\n- Independent of temperature\n- Common units: J/(kg·K) or ft·lbf/slug·°R\n\n**Universal Gas Constant (Ru):**\n- Ru = Mgas × R\n- The same for all ideal or perfect gases\n- Can be expressed as: Ru = k × NA\n  - k (Boltzmann's constant) = 1.381×10⁻²³ J/K\n  - NA (Avogadro's number) = 6.022×10²³ 1/mol\n\n**Gas Mixture Molecular Weight:**\n- Mmixture = Σ(xi × Mi)\n- Average based on mole fractions of each component gas"
